    "summary": "This unit gains the following when it is **selected to shoot** in your Shooting phase using **[close-quarters shooting](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting)**:\n\n- Its attacks against a unit **engaged** with it may ignore modifiers to **BS** and to **Hit rolls**.\n- You may remove **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** from any of its **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** weapons. Such a weapon can then target only an enemy unit that no other friendly unit is engaged with.",
